<title>UK: Camargo Correa sets $150 mln 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>Camargo Correa sets $150 mln 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAMARGO CORREA INDUSTRIAL SA SA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     8.75	MATURITY    22.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    22.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	PUT AND CALL ON 22.JUL.02</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-50-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	PUT AT 99.75 AND CALL AT 99.90</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
